abstract: >-
  LowPack is a local-first command-line tool and Python library for
  deterministic, application-aware, lossless archive packing. It combines
  safe indexing, chunk deduplication, explainable codec policy, reversible
  preparation, full verification, and checked migration while relying on
  established store, zlib, and Zstandard codecs. General, source, and
  telemetry profiles support offline project, backup, teaching, and research
  artifact workflows.
